WEBVTT

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.310
Good morning.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.350
Riko!

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.130
Oh no...

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:24.750
Are you doing okay?

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.340
No, it's burnt black...

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.470
I'm talking about you.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.290
I'm fine.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.120
I'll go make another one.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:43.430
Why do you keep stealing away my dream!?

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.690
I haven't given up yet.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.030
Riko!

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.070
Are you okay!?

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.910
Forget about breakfast, you should lie down.

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:06.710
I can't really sleep...

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.460
I can't get it out of my head.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:11.790
What happened yesterday.

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:14.310
I feel terrible towards Kirino-chan...

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:17.050
Let's talk to Kirino after she's calmed down.

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:18.300
I think...

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:21.820
...the both of you need some time right now.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:51.120
tomodachi ni mo ienakatta

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:56.450
omoi wo tojikometa mama no

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:01.540
kokoro no naka mahou no furuutsu

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:06.510
tabereba tsutawaru... nante ne

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:12.120
kyoushitsu de matteita no, mada

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:17.120
guuzen da to iiwake shiteru

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:22.710
sono egao wa tabun dareka no mono

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:28.170
yume ga watashi no negai wo kanaeru nara

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:33.120
sotto agetai purezento yo

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:38.290
anata no niji shiawase ni todoku

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:43.250
hashi e to kaeru wa te wo futte ne

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:48.530
ii no ii no

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:53.880
mitsumeteitai dake nano...

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:11.960
<i>A Past Taken Away</i>

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:37.990
Hello?

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:38.990
What is it?

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.360
But, right now...

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:48.950
Onii-chan.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:52.410
Stay with me forever, okay?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.580
Liar.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.880
I won't let you be the only one to use your Gift!

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.390
Wait, Kirino-chan!

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.470
I...

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:16.110
Onii-chan!

00:04:23.140 --> 00:04:24.070
No...

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.070
Don't leave me on my own...

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:29.620
Don't leave me...

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:31.930
Onii-chan...

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.080
Onii-chan!!!

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.100
Onii-chan?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:03.190
Onii-chan!

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:12.240
Onii-chan!

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:18.520
Onii-chan?

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:24.470
<i>I'm off to deliver something Dad forgot.
I'll be back before noon.  Haruhiko</i>

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:49.820
Yes?

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.340
Riko-chan...

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:03.050
Kirino-chan?

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:06.900
I'm coming in.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.040
Your mother is worried about you.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:28.270
You should eat something.

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:31.240
I'm not hungry.

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:36.450
Sorry...

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:40.100
Why are you apologizing?

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.810
Umm...

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.160
What?

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:47.810
I...

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:51.580
I felt I had to talk to you.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.100
About what?

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.920
I want to properly apologize.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.350
Because you don't want me to use my Gift?

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:03.320
No!

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:04.480
I won't use it.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:11.750
I knew it.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.040
Kirino-chan...?

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.080
You're not being fair, Riko-chan.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:22.210
I'm sorry...

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:25.210
You're always like that, aren't you?

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:29.210
Pretending to be a good girl, and having everything go your own way in the end.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.840
That's not...

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:32.510
I'm not pretending to be a good girl...

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.330
You're not?

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.180
Let me tell you then.

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:44.610
You were the one who proposed not to use our Gifts.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.330
Yet you are the one who used it.

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:49.860
How do you explain that?

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:52.050
I'm sorry...

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:56.240
You told me earlier, didn't you?

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.630
That you had already given up on him.

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:01.540
Yet in the end, you're going out with him. How do you explain that?

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.010
I'm sorry...

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:05.550
Do you really think apologizing will make everything all right?

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:06.460
No!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.740
I really feel bad about it!

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:12.170
About using my Gift...

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:14.300
It has always bothered me!

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.820
I regretted it.

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:18.270
That's why I...

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.550
You never even told me.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:25.630
If I hadn't heard from Haruhiko-kun, I would have never known.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.580
Isn't that right?

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.340
I properly told you, didn't I?

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:33.860
I properly told you when I used that fake Gift, didn't I?

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:38.110
I properly told you I didn't do it on purpose, didn't I?

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.330
In hindsight, I shouldn't have held back.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:46.940
I'm sorry...

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:53.270
I should have kept coming over to wake Haruhiko-kun despite your return.

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:54.830
I'm sorry...

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:57.800
I should have kept coming over to make him breakfast every morning.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.840
I'm sorry...

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:01.520
I should have just used my Gift!

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.220
I'm sorry!

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:05.190
"Sorry, sorry!"

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.560
If you're so sorry, how about breaking up with him!?

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.400
How about leaving that house!?

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.530
If you're just talk, I no longer want to hear it!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.530
Go away.

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:20.710
Go away!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.580
I have nothing to discuss with you anymore!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:33.880
As long as it doesn't concern Onii-chan, I'll do anything!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:38.150
So please...

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:39.930
Forgive me!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:43.930
Forgive me, Kirino-chan!

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:47.440
Forgive me!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:50.310
Then...

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:53.040
...give me back my memories.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:59.530
I want the memories of your time spent with Haruhiko-kun.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.690
I'll let you have the Haruhiko-kun from now.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:09.960
In return, I want you to give back the time you spent with Haruhiko-kun that was supposed to be mine.

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:14.120
But how would I do that...?

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:19.840
You would do anything, right?

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:23.600
Was that another lie?

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.220
Dad is unbelievable.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:55.380
Making me run errands at a time like this...

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:59.080
Didn't I tell you not to beat the final boss on your own?

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:00.960
I'm coming over right now, so wait up!

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:10.590
Elementary schoolers are already carrying cell phones?

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:12.020
In our time...

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:16.730
So I got a new family member yesterday.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.280
Is that so?

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:23.410
I'll introduce you to her tomorrow.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.540
Her name is Riko-chan.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.410
Should I bring her over right now?

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.890
No, that's all right.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.010
Okay.

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:32.340
Tomorrow it'll be then.

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:34.700
Hey, Haruhiko-kun.

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:36.170
What is it?

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:40.510
Could you keep this string phone a secret?

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:42.680
To Riko-chan as well.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:45.320
Why?

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:49.760
Because this our secret phone!

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:51.560
It has always been that way.

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:52.990
That's why...

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:55.560
Okay, I understand!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.250
Really?

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:58.760
Yep!

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:01.580
It's a promise!

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:04.080
Never ever tell anyone!

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:05.990
It's our little secret!

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:09.850
<i>I see...</i>

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.140
<i>Ever since that time, Kirino has...</i>

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:16.420
<i>That means I was the only one being thickheaded...</i>

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:21.110
<i>I have to properly set this straight myself.</i>

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.980
<i>I'll check up on Riko first...</i>

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.570
<i>...and talk to Kirino afterwards.</i>

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:51.980
I'm home.

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:54.060
Welcome back.

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:57.560
I will go make lunch.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.010
That's okay, you should get some sleep!

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.870
Riko, no need to make lunch for me.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.910
Whose were these again?

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:16.050
What are you talking about? We bought these on our school trip together!

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:17.720
School trip?

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:19.210
Together?

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:20.860
Hey!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.810
You're acting strange.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:26.940
I'm sorry!

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:28.580
No, I'm sorry.

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:29.440
It was my faul—

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:34.430
Huh?

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.150
Why am I crying?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.250
Why?

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.090
Riko!

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.770
What's the matter with you? Get a grip!

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:44.400
Onii-chan?

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:47.310
Yeah, that's right, it's me!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:48.380
Onii-chan?

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:51.000
What do you mean?

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.890
I don't have a brother!

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.030
I don't have any family!

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:57.270
Calm down!

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.090
This is your house, Riko!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:00.860
Excuse me.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.030
I will go make lunch now.

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:04.900
This isn't the time for that!

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.090
No...

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:08.610
I can't make you lunch.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:12.150
Kirino-chan!

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:14.240
Kirino-chan is coming!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:15.640
Kirino!?

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:16.770
Let me go!

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.420
Hurry! Let me go!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:19.760
Hey, calm down!

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:20.830
Why would Kirino...

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:26.840
You're my Onii-chan right now!

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:33.140
I'm sorry...

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:34.970
I...

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:40.350
Why did I...

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.340
I'm sorry, Kirino-chan...

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:49.060
I broke your tea cups...

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:52.870
I'm so sorry...

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:57.620
She's out?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.640
Yes...

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:01.340
She said something about going to see the rainbow...

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:14.510
Kirino!

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:16.970
Riko is acting strange.

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:19.740
Do you know anything about it?

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:22.390
Hey, Haruhiko-kun, do you remember?

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:26.270
On a rainy day when we were little...

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:29.610
...we went to see the rainbow here together, didn't we?

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:32.640
That rainbow is a present from me.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:34.310
What are you talking about?

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:35.650
Riko gave that...

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:37.050
And what about that time?

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:42.080
I went to the research facility in the middle of a storm to get tomatoes for you.

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:45.040
I got a nasty cold from that, didn't I?

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.670
I was so happy you were worried about me.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:48.760
Kirino...

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.860
You also saved me from a falling locker once, didn't you?

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:56.820
You even wanted to erase the rainbow for my sake!

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:59.820
But what I was most happy about...

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:03.030
...was when you called me family.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:04.810
When you called me your little sister!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.790
I was really happy about that!

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.210
Kirino...

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:11.720
So you used your Gift...

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:12.560
That's right.

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:13.990
I got it back.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:16.720
Everything Riko-chan took from me.

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:19.700
All the memories of her time spent with you.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:21.710
Kirino...

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:22.590
You...

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.460
Riko-chan gave them to me.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.130
In exchange for the Haruhiko-kun from this point on.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.950
That's why the rainbow isn't black.

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:32.700
See?

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:35.970
That's why it will be fine like this.

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:37.890
No way...

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:40.300
I'm sorry, Haruhiko-kun.

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:42.410
I caused you so much trouble...

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:46.360
But I won't be selfish any longer.

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.630
This is enough for me.

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:53.600
With this, I'll be able to move on.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.000
What are you doing?

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.550
I'm cleaning.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.940
But it's my shift this week.

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:13.240
But it's my job...

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.970
You don't have to do this!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.390
Umm...

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:20.180
You really don't remember?

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:25.020
We're family now.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.190
Isn't that right?

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:32.820
That's why you should call me "Onii-chan" from now!

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:35.630
What was that...?

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:44.020
I don't know...

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:45.500
Riko?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.540
I don't remember anything like that!

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:58.550
You damn moron!

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:12.820
Kirino...

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:17.570
It's been a while since I've come here.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:20.260
You always came to my place...

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.020
I'm sorry.

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:25.000
Hey, could you play once more?

00:18:25.590 --> 00:18:27.340
Hey, Haruhiko-kun...

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:30.210
I...

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:33.980
...can't play my piano piece until the end.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.830
I haven't been able to for a long time.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.490
Ever since that day...

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:47.840
A piano competition?

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:49.370
That's amazing, Kirino!

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:50.380
Do your best!

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.130
H-Hey, Haruhiko-kun...

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:54.780
Can I ask you a favor?

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:56.580
What is it?

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.440
Cheer me on...

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:01.550
I want you to come cheer me on!

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:05.460
Okay! I'll come cheer you on!

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:07.010
Really?

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:07.780
Yeah!

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:09.890
It's a promise!

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:11.190
Don't break it!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.510
Okay, I promise!

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:17.710
I waited...

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:22.290
I waited so long...

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:36.260
What?

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.430
E-Err...

00:19:39.430 --> 00:19:42.570
Did Riko-chan really leave?

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:43.780
Yeah.

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:46.230
That's a shame...

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:51.910
I had my competition today...

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:54.000
Oh, was that today?

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:57.670
How did it go?

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:01.270
I won the competition!

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:07.780
I won... the competition...

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:11.090
That's why I wish you could have seen me...

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.190
My little sister is gone!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.150
How could I ever go see you!?

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.010
I...

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:25.990
...always...

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:30.530
...wanted to be in Riko-chan's place.

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:32.380
That's why...

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:34.710
That's why I...

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:39.180
But you know, it's strange.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:42.440
I still can't play the piano!

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:44.800
Even though I have my memories with you...

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:48.110
Even though I got them back from Riko-chan!

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.360
Why!?

00:20:55.570 --> 00:20:56.550
Kirino...

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.310
Why, Haruhiko-kun...

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:00.680
What now?

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:01.950
What should I do now!?

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:04.460
What should I do!?

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:05.770
<i>It's my fault.</i>

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:08.410
<i>Both Kirino and Riko...</i>

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:11.950
<i>It's all because of me...</i>

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:20.620
I'm alone again...

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:26.750
At least you have always been with me, right?

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:28.630
I wonder why...

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:31.230
...I get that feeling.

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:33.240
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:21:35.570 --> 00:21:38.370
<i>I can't even remember your name...</i>

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:44.410
<i>Am I... really supposed to be here...?</i>

00:22:13.190 --> 00:22:17.370
kyoushitsu no sumikko de

00:22:18.260 --> 00:22:23.960
kuchizusanda okiniiri no uta

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:29.890
naze ka kyou wa kanashii kimochi ga

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:34.120
afureteshimatta yo

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:41.160
okaeri, watashi  machi wa yasashiku

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:44.950
mukaetekureru no

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:49.140
nee anata ni aitai na

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:56.260
umaku waraetenai toki wa sotto oshiete hoshii

00:22:56.260 --> 00:23:01.180
hikikaesenakunaru mae ni

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:05.130
futari kokoroniji wo kakete

00:23:05.130 --> 00:23:07.940
hitori ja nai to itte ne

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:13.980
inori ga todokimasu youni

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:33.750
I can't remember anything.

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:36.710
Not those incredibly precious days...

00:23:36.710 --> 00:23:38.610
...nor the people most important to me.

00:23:39.420 --> 00:23:42.310
Everything is slipping through my fingers.

00:23:43.460 --> 00:23:47.570
Gift was supposed to bring people happiness...

00:23:48.540 --> 00:23:50.980
Where could things have gone wrong?

00:23:50.950 --> 00:24:00.750
<i>The Secret of Gift</i>

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:55.220
Next time, "The Secret of Gift."

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:59.570
Gift. A present from a distant past...
